SUMMARY:Let Love Dissolve the Last Blockages to Your Predestined Good Life
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nThere’s so much 
 fear and hurt on Earth that doesn’t need to be here. People were taught 
 to hold onto situations that no longer serve their best interests. Everyth
 ing in your life served you at one time\, even if just for deciding what y
 ou don’t like. With love\, you can quickly realize what’s not right fo
 r you and let go. More love replaces less love\, because only love is real
  and your goal as a human being is to discover how much you’re loved and
  loving. Love is many things\; it’s whatever helps you to have a wonderf
 ul life in a wonderful world. You know when you get there thanks to the hu
 man emotions you need for feedback. Happy emotions say yes stay\, unhappy 
 emotions say no leave. Sadly\, many people resigned themselves to the “n
 o” emotions of fear and hurt in order to fit in the domination culture. 
 That’s the system of forcing things to happen without believing in the p
 ower of love. You can find techniques and tricks to superficially get what
  you want\, but in the end only real love will feel safe\, secure\, and mo
 st satisfying.\n\nJoin us this Sunday June 24\, 2026 for a free clarifying
  talk on how love can still work the miracles you need in a love-doubting 
 world. Mostly you just need to unlearn many false rules about life\, love\
 , and power. Love feels great\; it doesn’t cause hurt\, as so many peopl
 e were taught to expect in a hurt-based dominating society. Power isn’t 
 corrupting or bad\, since you need power’s ability to take action in ord
 er to love. And life is forever fabulous\; it’s what the whole of existe
 nce is geared to. Passion\, purpose\, joy\, belonging\, pleasure\, safety\
 , closeness\, trust\, beauty\, wonder\, gratitude\, confidence\, excitemen
 t\, and more are happy emotional states that signal an increase in life en
 ergy. The domination culture demands you forget these qualities until life
  is little more than a constant struggle for distraction from pain.\n\nAll
  of nature affirms the qualities of life\, and yet scientists who study na
 ture misinterpret their own results to say depressing things like entropy 
 is the unstoppable movement toward chaos and death. The whole universe is 
 expected to end in heat death\, when everything separates so much that not
 hing ever happens again. Rubbish! Heat death is the dumbest default form o
 f entropy\, which is the spreading out of energy. The best promoter of ent
 ropy is life itself\, as complex life forms and fertile planets like Earth
  process the most energy. Some biologists are beginning to see that entrop
 y is itself the life principle for which the whole universe is forever gea
 red.\n\nYou need to realize just how deeply the domination culture has imp
 aired your abilities to feel alive. Domination is based on threatening hur
 t rather than offering love. Love is considered weak and ineffective\, bec
 ause if you’re nice to someone then they’ll just take advantage of you
 . You’re supposed to expect that nobody cooperates and everybody compete
 s\, so hurting others before they hurt you is motivating. And it is true t
 hat avoiding hurt to seek pleasure is built into the human design\, but on
 ly so far as the pleasures are increasingly satisfying.\n\nA society built
  upon constant recurring hurt will perfect shallow pleasures for pain-numb
 ing addictions. Sex\, drugs\, and violent entertainments are popular\, wit
 h the drumbeat expectation of hurt making it unsafe to go deeper. Most peo
 ple can’t imagine much less really know that the Universe is alive\, mir
 acles are the norm\, healing is easy\, loving relationships are always ava
 ilable\, and the Source will give you whatever you ask. Healthy safe commu
 nity\, all kinds of support and intimacy\, peace\, abundant creativity\, p
 urposeful belonging\, heartfelt communication\, healing connections\, and 
 psychic exploration are just some of the ever-expanding human pleasures th
 at you can enjoy when you love yourself enough to leave the domination soc
 iety.\n\nFor this meetup\, remember when you felt most loved\, belonging\,
  safe\, and excited to be alive. Would you like that in all parts of your 
 own totally successful life? What stands in the way\, where do you need he
 aling? After some check-ins to share and relate\, I’ll explain the true 
 purpose of the physical world to individuate and refine our energy choices
  from spirit. We’ll study properties of love in relation to fear and neg
 ative energy. Positive beliefs say the Universe is your friend and everyth
 ing can be fit together to live happily. We conclude with a guided meditat
 ion to let in more love from the higher self to uncover the answers you ne
 eded within.\n\nWelcome! Our Inner Selves Mastery spiritual support group 
 is free online every Sunday 11am-130pm EDT\, with the last 30 minutes for 
 a guided meditation. If you can’t stay you can get the recording. You ca
 n signup here for this meeting and visit www.signupISM.com for all events\
 , newsletter\, videos\, and more.\n\nBest wishes\,\nCarl Johann Schroeder\
 nInner Selves Mastery\nspiritual teaching and coaching\nquick-links at [ww
 w.signupISM.com](http://www.signupISM.com)
